            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The sink has the dimensions 1000 x 190 x 500 mm and a weight of 14 kg. The final product is delivered with 5 kg packaging material, which is assumed to be corrugated board. The data are based on assupmtions and qualified estimates. Production takes place in Europe (Germany). The sink is transported 300 km to Switzerland. Energy consumption for mixing is estimated based on energy demand for the production of anhydrite floor and the energy use for hardening is based on manufacturer data.;
